   "body": "Here are the [b]non-repeatable[/b] versions of the 5 quests from [npc=7505] and [npc=7506]:\r\n\r\n[ul]\r\n[li][quest=2603][/li]\r\n[li][quest=2601][/li]\r\n[li][quest=2583][/li]\r\n[li][quest=2585][/li]\r\n[li][quest=2581][/li]\r\n[/ul]\r\n\r\n[b]In order to complete them all, you will need the following:[/b]\r\n\r\n[ul]\r\n[li]14x [item=8396][/li]\r\n[li]11x [item=8394][/li]\r\n[li]6x [item=8392][/li]\r\n[li]6x [item=8393][/li]\r\n[li]5x [item=8391][/li]\r\n[/ul]",
   "replies": []
