  {
   "rating": 9,
   "date": "2005-12-08T20:18:39-06:00",
   "body": "The buffs do not stack.&nbsp; If you have a stamina buff from a previous quest, do not turn in for agility.&nbsp; The earlier buff will be replaced by the new one.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 3,
