   "body": "just checked this, and yes, it does stack with mongoose potions. Very handy.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2021-04-19T23:45:50-05:00",
   "body": "Respawn rate for the Scorpok Stingers is horrible. About 15 min. When they are the rarest of the mobs in the area and there are usually 3-5 other people ( many of them lvl 60) farming them, it makes it next to impossible. I kill about 1-2 every 15 minutes. I've spent about 2.5 hours and got 2 of the needed pincers. Unless you really really really want the buff, it's not at all worth it. Complete waste of time.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 2,
   "date": "2005-11-02T08:18:39-06:00",
   "body": "What you can do is stock up the reagents and just fly in when you need a new one:D I mean any of the buffs from those things 50+stats is bloody good!",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
