  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2005-04-20T18:18:47-05:00",
   "body": "Wow, this quest is pretty awesome.  I was grinding away in the Blastlands and, when I got the needed reagents, I'd head back for a quick 4700xp.  The quest is repeatable.  I don't know if it has diminishing returns or not.  Also, when you first complete it, you not only get to +50agi item, but also +50agi immediately upon turning it in.  My 47 hunter was critting like it was going out of style.",
